WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.930 --> 00:00:04.410
Every year, the Academy
presents Awards of Merit

00:00:04.410 --> 00:00:08.230
in recognition of outstanding
technical advances.

00:00:08.230 --> 00:00:11.070
Tonight, we're going
to marvel and honor

00:00:11.070 --> 00:00:13.500
the inventions that
have made possible

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:17.580
the magic and the syntax
of motion pictures.

00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:19.080
Certainly, no group
in our industry

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:21.390
has unlocked the frontiers
and sought improvement

00:00:21.390 --> 00:00:24.690
so consistently as the
scientists and technicians.

00:00:24.690 --> 00:00:30.090
And we, even now, are assaulting
new visual and sonic frontiers

00:00:30.090 --> 00:00:30.900
of knowledge.

00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:32.700
This year's award
winners have made

00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:36.210
it possible for our work to
be seen, heard, and preserved

00:00:36.210 --> 00:00:37.740
a little better than before.

00:00:37.740 --> 00:00:40.620
Without all the contributions
past and present

00:00:40.620 --> 00:00:43.080
to the sciences of
filmmaking, there

00:00:43.080 --> 00:00:47.670
would simply not be an art
form known as the movies.

00:00:47.670 --> 00:00:52.370
For your fine contribution,
the industry salutes you.

